<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n40862" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπίσκεψις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εως</span>,
			ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>inspection, visitation</i>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Oec.</u>
				8.15
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῶν ἱερῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Lg.</u>
					849a
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῶν ἱππέων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Crass.</u>
					13
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐν ἐπισκέψει</span>
			<i>from the observer's</i>
			<i>point of view</i> (opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐν
				ὑποκειμένοις</span>), Alex.Philalethesap.<i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				8.726
			</span></i>; <i>visiting</i> of the sick, <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				5.56.8
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				<u>Libr.Propr.</u>
				1
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>.
				<i>investigation</i>, <i>inquiry</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Prorrh.</u>
				2.4
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ ἐ. ἦν, εἰ . . </span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>R.</u>
					456c
				</span></i>
			: pl., <i><span class="en">
				Phld.
				<u>Oec.</u>
				p.71J.
			</span></i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>. <i>numbering,
			census</i>, <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>Nu.</u>
				1.21
			</span></i>,al.</div>
